    "type": "game",
    "name": "Warden's Will",
    "steam_appid": 1689640,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/022d5b7622a1d7106edbace3dfbb6eae.avif?t=1743758353\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The multiverse is trapped in a relentless time loop, and only a Warden can break it. The Warden\u2019s Will is not to just survive, the Warden\u2019s Will is to dominate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brace for chaos. Unleash destruction. Dominate the corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready? Let\u2019s prepare you for the challenge ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>STEP I: MASTER YOUR WARDEN'S MOVEMENT &amp; ABILITIES</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Wardens await, each with their own movement kits and devastating abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly and rain missiles. Hover and unleash deadly lasers. Dash and slash through enemies. Leap like a rabbit and land like a rhino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/28724718eb41075f0bacc201a9e61e8b.poster.avif?t=1743758353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/28724718eb41075f0bacc201a9e61e8b.webm?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/28724718eb41075f0bacc201a9e61e8b.mp4?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>STEP II: WIELD INSANE WEAPONS AND OVERPOWERING AUGMENTS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lasers, bullets, fireballs\u2014even black-holes. Choose from a wild arsenal of heat based weapons, all with a dual firing system. Mix and match weapons and wardens, and loot hundreds of augments to unleash game-breaking synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The multiverse\u2019s power is yours to break!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/48879cd0054747784880056f19ea503c.poster.avif?t=1743758353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/48879cd0054747784880056f19ea503c.webm?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/48879cd0054747784880056f19ea503c.mp4?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>STEP III: EXPLORE EPIC VERTICAL WORLDS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight intense battles in entangled landscapes that test your every move. From scorching lava lands and mysterious deep caves to endless deserts and even space stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/eefb3c3d80559958ff6a11b580828a9f.poster.avif?t=1743758353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/eefb3c3d80559958ff6a11b580828a9f.webm?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/eefb3c3d80559958ff6a11b580828a9f.mp4?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>STEP IV: DOMINATE HORDES OF CORRUPTED ROBOTS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay alert at all times\u2014the hordes will test your reflexes. Be swift! fly, dodge and dash through the corrupted robots and their fireworks of projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/d60580e144dffa4eb33cbfd0bdacd540.poster.avif?t=1743758353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/d60580e144dffa4eb33cbfd0bdacd540.webm?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/d60580e144dffa4eb33cbfd0bdacd540.mp4?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>STEP V: GO SOLO OR TEAM UP</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the challenge alone or team up with up-to 2 friends to face the overwhelming corruption and create even more powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/660fc18c0c5b49a832282637a44047fe.poster.avif?t=1743758353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/660fc18c0c5b49a832282637a44047fe.webm?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/660fc18c0c5b49a832282637a44047fe.mp4?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>FINALLY: TURN BULLET HELL INTO BULLET HEAVEN!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is inevitable but every failure is a lesson. Each time you fall, you will learn not just how to survive, but how to dominate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/9d50a5bfd8087d3ce712dc776da0ed57.avif?t=1743758353\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are you ready? Good luck! You\u2019re gonna need it!</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/022d5b7622a1d7106edbace3dfbb6eae.avif?t=1743758353\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The multiverse is trapped in a relentless time loop, and only a Warden can break it. The Warden\u2019s Will is not to just survive, the Warden\u2019s Will is to dominate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brace for chaos. Unleash destruction. Dominate the corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready? Let\u2019s prepare you for the challenge ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>STEP I: MASTER YOUR WARDEN'S MOVEMENT &amp; ABILITIES</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Wardens await, each with their own movement kits and devastating abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly and rain missiles. Hover and unleash deadly lasers. Dash and slash through enemies. Leap like a rabbit and land like a rhino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/28724718eb41075f0bacc201a9e61e8b.poster.avif?t=1743758353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/28724718eb41075f0bacc201a9e61e8b.webm?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/28724718eb41075f0bacc201a9e61e8b.mp4?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>STEP II: WIELD INSANE WEAPONS AND OVERPOWERING AUGMENTS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lasers, bullets, fireballs\u2014even black-holes. Choose from a wild arsenal of heat based weapons, all with a dual firing system. Mix and match weapons and wardens, and loot hundreds of augments to unleash game-breaking synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The multiverse\u2019s power is yours to break!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/48879cd0054747784880056f19ea503c.poster.avif?t=1743758353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/48879cd0054747784880056f19ea503c.webm?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/48879cd0054747784880056f19ea503c.mp4?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>STEP III: EXPLORE EPIC VERTICAL WORLDS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight intense battles in entangled landscapes that test your every move. From scorching lava lands and mysterious deep caves to endless deserts and even space stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/eefb3c3d80559958ff6a11b580828a9f.poster.avif?t=1743758353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/eefb3c3d80559958ff6a11b580828a9f.webm?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/eefb3c3d80559958ff6a11b580828a9f.mp4?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>STEP IV: DOMINATE HORDES OF CORRUPTED ROBOTS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay alert at all times\u2014the hordes will test your reflexes. Be swift! fly, dodge and dash through the corrupted robots and their fireworks of projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/d60580e144dffa4eb33cbfd0bdacd540.poster.avif?t=1743758353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/d60580e144dffa4eb33cbfd0bdacd540.webm?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/d60580e144dffa4eb33cbfd0bdacd540.mp4?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>STEP V: GO SOLO OR TEAM UP</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the challenge alone or team up with up-to 2 friends to face the overwhelming corruption and create even more powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/660fc18c0c5b49a832282637a44047fe.poster.avif?t=1743758353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/660fc18c0c5b49a832282637a44047fe.webm?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/660fc18c0c5b49a832282637a44047fe.mp4?t=1743758353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>FINALLY: TURN BULLET HELL INTO BULLET HEAVEN!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is inevitable but every failure is a lesson. Each time you fall, you will learn not just how to survive, but how to dominate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/9d50a5bfd8087d3ce712dc776da0ed57.avif?t=1743758353\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are you ready? Good luck! You\u2019re gonna need it!</strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "Warden\u2019s Will is a fast paced movement shooter roguelite, playable solo or in up-to 3 player co-op. Choose your Warden, master unique movements and abilities, and overpower hordes of robots in intense battles. Fly, dash, smash, and turn bullet-hell into bullet-heaven!",
